<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108270" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόδεσ-ις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποδέω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>under-bandaging,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>putting on one's shoes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1257a9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cael.</u>
				271a33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Gall.</u>
				26
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> concrete, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑποδήματα</span>
			, <i>foot-gear,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				173b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Mem.</u>
				1.2.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Duris
				14
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				10.4.16
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				322a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>R.</u>
				425b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				5.45
			</span></i>:—also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόδησις</span>
			(q. v.).</div>
